WEBVTT

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.936
our independence and our well-being

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.120
in these many, many decades
that we're going to live.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:41.456
My journey has taken me
from a place of fear and shame

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:44.736
to one of humility and understanding.

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.896
I'm ready now to link shields with others,

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.496
to fight this fight,

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.656
and I'm inviting you to join me.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.056
Thank you.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:59.120
(Applause)